# ESP32 Smart Wall Switch

A WiFi-controlled smart wall switch automation system using ESP32 and dual servo motors.

---

## Features

- WiFi-based switch control
- ESP32 hosted web interface
- Dual servo wall switch actuation
- OLED IP display
- Mobile-friendly control page
- Physical switch automation



## Hardware Used

- ESP32
- 2x SG90 Servo Motors
- OLED Display
- Breadboard
- Jumper Wires
- USB Power Supply

---

## Pin Connections

| Component | ESP32 GPIO |
|---|---|
| ON Servo | GPIO 13 |
| OFF Servo | GPIO 12 |
| OLED SDA | GPIO 21 |
| OLED SCL | GPIO 22 |

---

## Software Requirements

- Arduino IDE
- ESP32 Board Package
- ESP32Servo Library

---

## Installation

1. Install ESP32 board package
2. Install `ESP32Servo` library
3. Upload the code
4. Connect ESP32 to WiFi
5. Open the displayed IP address in browser

---

## Web Interface

The ESP32 hosts a local webpage with ON and OFF buttons to physically toggle the wall switch using servo motors.

---

